{"page":101,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:141","surah":4,"ayah":141,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَتَرَبَّصُونَ بِكُمْ فَإِن كَانَ لَكُمْ فَتْحٌ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ قَالُوٓا۟ أَلَمْ نَكُن مَّعَكُمْ وَإِن كَانَ لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ نَصِيبٌ قَالُوٓا۟ أَلَمْ نَسْتَحْوِذْ عَلَيْكُمْ وَنَمْنَعْكُم مِّنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ۚ فَٱللَّهُ يَحْكُمُ بَيْنَكُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ وَلَن يَجْعَلَ ٱللَّهُ لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ عَلَى ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ سَبِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The [hypocrites] wait to see what happens to you and, if God brings you success, they say, ‘Were we not on your side?’ but if the disbelievers have some success, they say to them, ‘Did we not have the upper hand over you, and [yet] protect you from the believers?’ God will judge between you all on the Day of Resurrection, and He will give the disbelievers no means of overcoming the believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَتَرَبَّصُونَ","en_gloss":"are waiting","transliteration":"yatarabbaṣūna","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"bikum","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَتْحٌۭ","en_gloss":"a victory","transliteration":"fatḥun","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Were not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَكُن","en_gloss":"we","transliteration":"nakun","verse_key":"4:141"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّعَكُمْ","en_g